Third-party data in tests/fixtures/structured/

The inputs and expected outputs in these directories are trimmed excerpts of publisher releases,
kept as test fixtures. Each directory's PROVENANCE.md names the original file, its SHA-256 and
how it was trimmed. The expected.json files are this service's conversion of the excerpts and
carry the same terms as their inputs.

